    "staffing_inputs",
    "habitability_profile",
    "visual_profile_stack",
    "provenance"
  ],
  "rules": [
    "Search valid canonical/authored designs before generating a new design.",
    "A new procedural design is created only when no selected existing design adequately fits role, scale, era, operator and site.",
    "Generated design_id is deterministic and reusable for later facilities in the same design ecosystem.",
    "Different individual facilities may share design_id but never share facility_id or live state.",
    "Do not add capabilities merely to make a design convenient.",
    "Modules exist because a required/optional capability was selected.",
    "Defensive systems require operator, strategic context and legal/organizational justification.",
    "Habitation capacity is sized from staff/resident requirements plus emergency margin, not visual scale.",
    "Docking capacity is sized from actual throughput and vessel-size demand.",
    "Procedural visual geometry follows operator/era/facility-role grammar after function is fixed."
  ],
  "anti_generic_rule": "No procedural station may become an all-services starbase unless its resolved scale and need package independently justify those capabilities."
}
